      "set": "test",
      "author": "agent B (independent case author)",
      "source": "SPEC 15 substitute for the owner's project: temperature alarm. 9 V DC input through a power switch and 1N4007 to VIN; Waveshare LCD1602 I2C (the module has its own I2C pull-ups); DHT22 on D2 with 10k pull-up; active buzzer on D8 via 2N2222A; push button on D3 with 10k pull-down and 100 nF; green/red status LEDs on D5/D6; 10k threshold pot on A0",
      "pinSources": {
        "U1": "Aosong DHT22 (AM2302) datasheet, Pin table ('1 VDD, 2 DATA, 3 NULL, 4 GND'): https://www.sparkfun.com/datasheets/Sensors/Temperature/DHT22.pdf"
      }
    }
